---
title: Cheddar Chicken Broccoli Casserole
source: Emma
servings: 4
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 45 minutes
---

Preheat oven to 375 degrees.

Add @cheddar broccoli rice{2%packs}, @cream of chicken soup{1%can}, and @chicken broth{2%cans worth} to a #casserole dish{}. Stir well.

Place chopped @broccoli{1%head} and @chicken breasts{3}(sliced into thin strips) on top.

Cover with aluminum foil and cook for ~{40%minutes}.

Uncover, add @cheddar cheese{2%cups} on top, and cook for a final ~{5%minutes} until melted and bubbly.
